# Draw's messages, in TAIRiX Bridge's own words.
Reserved:A flag Draw keeps for itself is set
BadElement:The path holds an element Draw does not know
Looped:The path's continuations lead back on themselves
Order:The path's elements are in an order Draw cannot follow
Lengthens:Done in place, this would change the path's length
Full:The output path has no room for more
Flatten:The path's curves must be flattened first
CapJoin:The cap and join block asks for a cap or join Draw does not have
Overflow:The matrix takes a point outside the coordinates Draw can hold
Unsupported:Draw has no floating-point form of this call
